rule FiscalPeriodGrain
	lineageTag: 3dea38cc-e913-57a4-8d4d-ac9dec2a97db
	statement: Budgets are planned at fiscal period grain (usually month). Analyse at period, quarter or year level; year-to-date totals accumulate from the first period of the fiscal year, which may differ from January. Flow accounts sum over time; balance accounts take the period-end value.
	ruleReferencedEntity BudgetLine
		propertyScope: specific
		ruleReferencedProperty PeriodDate
	ruleReferencedEntity Account
	ruleReferencedRelationship 'Line On Date'
